{{also|Mergus}}
==Latin==
[[File:Common Loon with chick.jpg|thumb|mergus (diver, loon)]]

===Etymology===
From {{m|la|mergō||dive, plunge}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mergus|mergī|m|second}}

# [[diver]] ([[loon]]), a kind of [[waterfowl]]
# [[vine]]-[[layer]]

====Usage notes====
Classical Latin applied the term ''mergus'' to the [[diver]] ([[loon]]), but modern taxonomic Latin applies this term to the [[merganser]], and calls the diver {{m|la|gāvia}}.

